          <a href="/news/all-news/nctc-foundation-hosts-annual-donor-scholar-breakfast-2026.php" class="news-ct__items-item">
  <div class="news-ct__items-item_image">
    <img alt="Student and donors on stage at NCTC Donor Scholar Breakfast" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="false" width="412" height="456" src="/media/nctc/images/news-images/QV2A5905.JPG">
  </div>
  <div class="news-ct__items-item-info">
    <div class="title">NCTC Foundation Hosts Annual Donor Scholar Breakfast 2026</div>
    <div class="desc"><p>The North Central Texas College (NCTC) Foundation hosted its annual Donor Scholar Breakfast on Friday, November 6, on the Gainesville campus. The event honored scholarship recipients and the donors who make their education possible, providing an opportunity for students to personally thank their supporters.</p></div>
    <div class="date">Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:17:00 CST</div>
  </div>
</a><a href="/news/all-news/nctc-board-of-regents-vacancy.php" class="news-ct__items-item">
  <div class="news-ct__items-item_image">
    <img alt="Board of Regents Event Tile" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="false" width="412" height="456" src="/media/nctc/images/webp/Board of Regents Tile.webp">
  </div>
  <div class="news-ct__items-item-info">
    <div class="title">NCTC Board of Regents Vacancy</div>
    <div class="desc"><p>The North Central Texas College (NCTC) Board of Regents is accepting letters of interest to fill a vacancy on the board. Board Chair Karla Metzler submitted her resignation Monday evening, and the vacant seat is expected to be filled by December 1, 2026.&nbsp;</p></div>
    <div class="date">Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:03:00 CDT</div>
  </div>
</a><a href="/news/all-news/nctc-volleyballs-coach-bullard-reaches-500-wins.php" class="news-ct__items-item">
  <div class="news-ct__items-item_image">
    <img alt="Coach Bullard 500 Wins team photo" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="false" width="412" height="456" src="/media/nctc/images/news-images/Coach Bullard 500 Wins.jpg">
  </div>
  <div class="news-ct__items-item-info">
    <div class="title">NCTC Volleyball’s Coach Bullard Reaches 500 Wins</div>
    <div class="desc"><p class="xmsonormal" style="margin: 0in;"><span style="font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; color: black;">North Central Texas College Volleyball Coach Angie Bullard earned her 500<sup>th</sup><span class="apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span>career win last week, as the Lady Lions defeated Temple College at the Lions Gym in 4 sets.<span class="apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span></span></p></div>
    <div class="date">Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:32:26 CDT</div>
  </div>
</a><a href="/news/all-news/robeson-excellence-in-teaching-award-winners-announced.php" class="news-ct__items-item">
  <div class="news-ct__items-item_image">
    <img alt="Congratulations filler news image" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="false" width="412" height="456" src="/media/nctc/images/news-images/Congratulations-filler-news-image.jpg">
  </div>
  <div class="news-ct__items-item-info">
    <div class="title">Robeson Excellence in Teaching Award Winners Announced</div>
    <div class="desc"><p>Thanks to the generous support of former North Central Texas College (NCTC) employee Maurice Robeson Irish, the NCTC Foundation announced the winners of the 2026-2027 <strong>Robeson Excellence in Teaching Award</strong>. This award provides funding to help NCTC faculty bring innovative ideas to life that enhance student learning and enrich the overall student experience at the college.</p></div>
    <div class="date">Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:48:59 CDT</div>
  </div>
</a>
          
